cvc5_modes_block_models_mode_to_string.doc:
Get a string representation of a Cvc5BlockModelsMode.
@param mode The mode.
@return The string representation.

cvc5_modes_learned_lit_type_to_string.doc:
Get a string representation of a Cvc5LearnedLitType.
@param type The learned literal type.
@return The string representation.

cvc5_modes_proof_component_to_string.doc:
Get a string representation of a Cvc5ProofComponent.
@param pc The proof component.
@return The string representation.

cvc5_modes_proof_format_to_string.doc:
Get a string representation of a Cvc5ProofFormat.
@param format The proof format.
@return The string representation.

cvc5_modes_find_synth_target_to_string.doc:
Get a string representation of a Cvc5FindSynthTarget.
@param target The synthesis find target.
@return The string representation.

cvc5_modes_option_category_to_string.doc:
Get a string representation of a Cvc5OptionCategory.
@param cat The option category.
@return The string representation.

cvc5_modes_input_language_to_string.doc:
Get a string representation of a Cvc5InputLanguage.
@param lang The input language.
@return The string representation.

cvc5_proof_rule_to_string.doc:
Get a string representation of a Cvc5ProofRule.
@param rule The proof rule.
@return The string representation.

cvc5_proof_rule_hash.doc:
Hash function for Cvc5ProofRule.
@param rule The proof rule.
@return The hash value.

cvc5_proof_rewrite_rule_to_string.doc:
Get a string representation of a Cvc5ProofRewriteRule.
@param rule The proof rewrite rule.
@return The string representation.

cvc5_proof_rewrite_rule_hash.doc:
Hash function for Cvc5ProofRewriteRule.
@param rule The proof rewrite rule.
@return The hash value.

cvc5_skolem_id_to_string.doc:
Get a string representation of a Cvc5SkolemId.
@param id The skolem id.
@return The string representation.

cvc5_skolem_id_hash.doc:
Hash function for Cvc5SkolemId.
@param id The skolem id.
@return The hash value.
